WEBVTT

00:32.682 --> 00:38.224
The spotlight's dead The cable's coiled

00:40.565 --> 00:45.887
The magic trick has been completely spoiled

00:47.147 --> 00:52.129
Just an echo bouncing off the concrete floor

00:56.455 --> 01:02.857
No one's knocking at the backstage door Empty

01:03.017 --> 01:04.437
arenas

01:06.698 --> 01:12.460
Where the echoes go to die Empty arenas

01:14.867 --> 01:20.273
Beneath the painted sky We used to set this room

01:20.374 --> 01:27.802
on fire Now we're just preaching to the wire In

01:28.844 --> 01:30.025
these empty eyes

01:47.726 --> 01:51.389
Ticket stubs are swept away

01:53.891 --> 02:01.538
Just ghosts remembering yesterday

02:01.898 --> 02:06.942
I look out at the velvet seats

02:11.070 --> 02:19.196
